 ## Shared principles
-All methods in this family rely on the differentiability of the forward rendering operator and the propagation of gradients through the integration steps [13295-normal-consistency-and-alignment.md]. The core mechanism is the evaluation of the volume rendering equation and the computation of gradients with respect to scene parameters (density, geometry, transfer functions, camera poses) [13295-normal-consistency-and-alignment.md].
